cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  SENTINEL-E: Anytime-Valid Sequential Detection for Streaming Illegal Dumping
  Surveillance
abstract: >-
  A three-layer wrapper that converts any frozen per-frame dumping detector into
  a network of anytime-valid sequential detectors with time-uniform false-alarm
  control. Its core is the episodic e-process, which mixes over episodes rather
  than changepoints via a two-state Markov chain, remains an exact non-negative
  supermartingale, and costs O(1) per frame.
type: software
